            <h3 class="pt display" id="p4t">CI/CD Pipeline</h3>
            <p class="pd">A CI/CD pipeline for an HR web application (GP4YOU). Deployments are automated with Jenkins and Argo CD using a GitOps approach, with services containerised in Docker and orchestrated on Kubernetes (Minikube). Automated tests (Jest, Cypress) and application security tests (XSS, CSRF) run in the pipeline.</p>
